# Talos: `just talos render-config` writes plaintext machine configs to talos/output,
# and `just talos download-image` saves installer ISOs under talos/. /output/ catches
# a bare `topf render` run from the repo root, which defaults to ./output.
/talos/output/
/output/
/talos/*.iso
